WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.724 --> 00:00:15.968
An astronaut entered a space station.

2
00:00:18.248 --> 00:00:20.469
She drank from a pouch as she looked out a window.

3
00:00:21.489 --> 00:00:22.449
Suddenly she gasped.

4
00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:26.611
A small object was floating near the space station.

5
00:00:27.291 --> 00:00:28.731
She waved over another astronaut.

6
00:00:28.751 --> 00:00:30.012
"Officer Wells!

7
00:00:30.472 --> 00:00:31.472
What is that thing?"

8
00:00:32.828 --> 00:00:34.368
Officer Wells looked out the window.

9
00:00:34.388 --> 00:00:37.869
"I'm not sure, Dr.

10
00:00:37.929 --> 00:00:39.830
Chen. But it looks like a spaceship!"

11
00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.651
The astronauts put on their spacesuits and went outside.

12
00:00:44.391 --> 00:00:46.452
They hooked a rope onto the space station.

13
00:00:47.752 --> 00:00:50.073
Then they carefully floated toward the spaceship.

14
00:00:51.513 --> 00:00:52.633
Officer Wells grabbed it.

15
00:00:52.653 --> 00:00:54.434
"Let's bring it inside."

16
00:00:55.234 --> 00:00:56.334
Dr. Chen bit her lip.

17
00:00:56.354 --> 00:00:58.555
"I don't think that's a good idea."

18
00:00:58.575 --> 00:01:01.656
"It's fine," Officer Wells said.

19
00:01:03.944 --> 00:01:04.965
Officer Wells and Dr.

20
00:01:04.985 --> 00:01:06.885
Chen brought the tiny spaceship inside.

21
00:01:09.987 --> 00:01:10.927
A hatch popped open.

22
00:01:12.848 --> 00:01:14.228
They heard soft footsteps.

23
00:01:15.309 --> 00:01:16.569
Dr. Chen held her breath.

24
00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:20.871
A small, furry creature stepped out of the spaceship.

25
00:01:21.491 --> 00:01:25.093
"Furbit!" Officer Wells smiled.

26
00:01:25.113 --> 00:01:26.993
"Aww! How cute!"

27
00:01:28.374 --> 00:01:29.815
Furbit pulled a wrench off the wall.

28
00:01:31.855 --> 00:01:33.056
Chomp! Gulp!

29
00:01:33.692 --> 00:01:34.553
It ate the wrench.

30
00:01:36.695 --> 00:01:38.096
Then it ate a sleeping bag.

31
00:01:43.961 --> 00:01:46.963
Furbit!" Officer Wells laughed.

32
00:01:48.264 --> 00:01:50.947
"Wow! He's a hungry little guy!"

33
00:01:52.048 --> 00:01:53.229
Dr. Chen shook her head.

34
00:01:53.249 --> 00:01:55.871
"This was a bad idea!"

35
00:01:55.891 --> 00:02:01.716
"There is so much trash here," Terrell said.

36
00:02:02.944 --> 00:02:05.466
Roxy and her friends were doing volunteer work at a playground.

37
00:02:06.227 --> 00:02:07.268
They were cleaning up litter.

38
00:02:08.288 --> 00:02:09.690
Jack held a big trash bag.

39
00:02:11.431 --> 00:02:12.452
He opened and closed it.

40
00:02:13.172 --> 00:02:14.393
It looked like it was talking.

41
00:02:14.413 --> 00:02:17.936
"I eat trash!"

42
00:02:18.397 --> 00:02:19.778
Jack said in a monster voice.

43
00:02:21.099 --> 00:02:23.020
Everyone laughed.

44
00:02:24.401 --> 00:02:26.423
Mara carried some dirty wrappers over to Jack.

45
00:02:26.443 --> 00:02:30.106
"Open up, Trash Monster," she said.

46
00:02:31.107 --> 00:02:32.368
Jack opened the bag wide.

47
00:02:33.108 --> 00:02:34.389
Mara threw the wrappers in.

48
00:02:35.109 --> 00:02:36.370
Jack quickly closed the bag.

49
00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:37.931
"Chomp, chomp!"

50
00:02:38.551 --> 00:02:40.012
Mara shook her head and laughed.

51
00:02:42.154 --> 00:02:43.434
Then she picked up more litter.

52
00:02:44.435 --> 00:02:47.037
Roxy and Terrell found rusty cans under some shrubs.

53
00:02:48.497 --> 00:02:49.338
Terrell sighed.

54
00:02:50.278 --> 00:02:51.759
"This will take all day."

55
00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:53.220
Roxy nodded.

56
00:02:53.240 --> 00:02:55.141
"You might be right, Terrell."

57
00:02:55.942 --> 00:02:56.842
Mara walked over.

58
00:02:56.862 --> 00:02:59.304
"I wish Rocket Girl could help us.

59
00:02:59.964 --> 00:03:02.826
She could clean up this playground in a second."

60
00:03:04.227 --> 00:03:05.848
Terrell and Roxy looked at each other.

61
00:03:07.169 --> 00:03:08.730
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

62
00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:10.811
"Oh!" Roxy said.

63
00:03:10.831 --> 00:03:12.833
"I see litter near the slide!"

64
00:03:14.934 --> 00:03:15.955
She ran to the slide.

65
00:03:15.975 --> 00:03:19.037
"Mayor Bloom," Roxy said.

66
00:03:19.057 --> 00:03:20.678
"Is there a problem?"

67
00:03:20.698 --> 00:03:23.640
"Rocket Girl," Mayor Bloom said.

68
00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:26.442
"I just got a call from the Space Agency.

69
00:03:27.463 --> 00:03:29.484
They lost contact with their space station.

70
00:03:30.028 --> 00:03:31.511
They're worried it was destroyed.

71
00:03:32.092 --> 00:03:33.334
They asked me to call you."

72
00:03:33.354 --> 00:03:36.119
"Don't worry, Mayor," Roxy said.

73
00:03:36.139 --> 00:03:38.303
"I'll find out what happened!"
